ent spec? We also build to custom order.","box":{"x":48,"y":794,"w":684,"h":18},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"100+","box":{"x":331,"y":876,"w":107,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Regions","box":{"x":361,"y":924,"w":46,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"99.9%","box":{"x":313,"y":992,"w":142,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Uptime","box":{"x":363,"y":1040,"w":41,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"25,000+","box":{"x":291,"y":1107,"w":185,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Clients","box":{"x":364,"y":1155,"w":40,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"24/7","box":{"x":335,"y":1223,"w":98,"h":44},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Support","box":{"x":361,"y":1271,"w":46,"h":16},"links":[]},{"t":"img","src":"https://framerusercontent.com/images/es2S8XiQxHYO7MaYzX1pocRZACg.png?width=1920&height=1080","alt":"Loose-tube outdoor fiber optic cable on a reel","box":{"x":-193,"y":1514,"w":1155,"h":410},"nat":[1155,649]},{"t":"p","text":"What it is","box":{"x":16,"y":1952,"w":736,"h":35},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Loose-tube stranded cable is the workhorse of outside plant. Fibers sit loose in gel-filled tubes stranded around a central member, giving the cable the mechanical and environmental protection outdoor routes demand: duct, aerial or direct-burial. Its all-dielectric, non-metallic construction removes the need for bonding and grounding.","box":{"x":16,"y":2000,"w":736,"h":119},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Construction","box":{"x":38,"y":2165,"w":692,"h":20},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Stranded loose-tube, gel-filled","box":{"x":38,"y":2191,"w":692,"h":20},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Strength member","box":{"x":38,"y":2247,"w":692,"h":20},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Non-metallic (all-dielectric)","box":{"x":38,"y":2274,"w":692,"h":20},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Fiber type","box":{"x":38,"y":2330,"w":692,"h":20},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"G.652D single-mode (G.657A1 available)","box":{"x":38,"y":2356,"w":692,"h":20},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Fiber counts","