{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Fujikura preform glass: tier 1 manufacturing, consistent quality.","box":{"x":36,"y":4688,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Lead times that move: supply when domestic loose-tube is quoted months out.","box":{"x":36,"y":4802,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Import/export handled: documentation, customs and delivery coordinated.","box":{"x":36,"y":4916,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"svg","w":24},{"t":"p","text":"Founded in 1998: a supplier that also runs networks.","box":{"x":36,"y":5030,"w":696,"h":22},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Loose-tube fiber cable FAQ","box":{"x":16,"y":5179,"w":736,"h":35},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"What fiber counts are available?","box":{"x":38,"y":5264,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"12F to 864F in loose-tube stranded construction, specified build-to-order.","box":{"x":38,"y":5298,"w":692,"h":25},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Is the cable all-dielectric?","box":{"x":38,"y":5379,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Yes. GCYFTY/GYFS are non-metallic, so no bonding or grounding is required.","box":{"x":38,"y":5413,"w":692,"h":25},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"What are typical lead times?","box":{"x":38,"y":5493,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Confirmed at quote stage against your count and volume; build-to-order sourcing lets us supply when domestic stock is constrained.","box":{"x":38,"y":5527,"w":692,"h":50},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Do you supply across North America?","box":{"x":38,"y":5633,"w":692,"h":24},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Yes, including California and multi-state footprints, with import/export handled.","box":{"x":38,"y":5667,"w":692,"h":25},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Need a Fiber Built to Your Exact Specification?","box":{"x":50,"y":5776,"w":668,"h":32},"links":[]},{"t":"p","text":"Fiber count, jacket, rating and connector, we can source and build any fiber optic cable to match your spec."